  "bodyHtml": "<main class=\"main\"><section class=\"c-post-info\"><div class=\"c-post-info__container\"><p>\n<span class=\"c-post-info__read-time\"></span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Updated&nbsp;<span class=\"c-post-info__date\">27.07.22</span></p></div></section><section  class=\"cb-text-box cb-text-box6a0fed671732d cb-text-box--type-one cb-text-box--align-left\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__container padding-top-sm padding-bottom-none\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__text\"><h1>Oh My AI</h1><p>Artificial Intelligence of some sort or another has been around for a number of years now, but as each day goes by it just keeps getting better and better. Every day I&#8217;m seeing at least 3 or 4 new AI tools on <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/\">Product Hunt</a> so, seeing some of these amazing applications recently has inspired me to write about some of them.</p><h2>Runway Video Editor</h2><p>This exciting new video editor bills itself as the &#8220;fastest way to edit video&#8221; and it certainly looks that way.</p><p>It provides many different time-saving functions that would normally take a long time to do so manually.</p><p>The first is background removal, essentially offering a post-greenscreen to use on-demand.</p><p>Next up is the &#8220;Inpainting&#8221; tool, this one allows you to quickly remove objects from videos. The term inpainting was new to me, but after doing some research there are a number of free online inpainting tools that are for photographs only, such as <a href=\"https://theinpaint.com/\">theInpaint.com</a>. In addition to this, the latest <a href=\"https://www.cnet.com/tech/services-and-software/say-buh-bye-to-photobombers-with-this-magic-pixel-6-camera-trick/\">Google Pixel</a> phone had this feature and having seen it done in person, it is very cool.</p><p>I had a quick play of the video editor with some video I took ages ago and the greenscreen works well.</p><div style=\"width: 1080px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><!--[if lt IE 9]><![endif]--><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-1942-1\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"/media/2022/05/runway-test.mp4\" /><a href=\"/media/2022/05/runway-test.mp4\">/media/2022/05/runway-test.mp4</a></video></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>DALL·E</h2><p>This is an incredibly exciting project that&#8217;s been getting a lot of hype recently. <a href=\"https://openai.com/blog/dall-e/\">DALL·E</a> is a tool for generating images by just entering a string of text, and it&#8217;s amazing what it can come up with. It&#8217;s so creative that you wouldn&#8217;t believe a robot is behind it.</p><p>Check out some examples below:</p></div></div></section><section  class=\"cb-carousel cb-carousel6a0fed6717599 cb-carousel--type-one\"\nstyle=\"\" data-delay=\"2500\" data-loop=\"1\" data-autoplay=\"1\"><div class=\"cb-carousel__container padding-top-none padding-bottom-none\"><div class=\"swiper-container\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"cb-carousel__image\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"498\" data-src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed.png 510w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed-300x293.png 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px\" / srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed.png 510w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122019-transformed-300x293.png 300w\"></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"cb-carousel__image\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122110-transformed.png\" width=\"605\" height=\"583\" data-src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122110-transformed.png\" class=\"attachment-large 