class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"cb-carousel__image\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed.png\" width=\"611\" height=\"597\" data-src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed.png 611w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed-300x293.png 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 611px) 100vw, 611px\" / srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed.png 611w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-122057-transformed-300x293.png 300w\"></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"cb-carousel__image\">\n<img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed.png\" width=\"708\" height=\"657\" data-src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed.png 708w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed-300x278.png 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 708px) 100vw, 708px\" / srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed.png 708w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-121908-transformed-300x278.png 300w\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class=\"cb-text-box cb-text-box6a0fed6717fe5 cb-text-box--type-one cb-text-box--align-left\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__container padding-top-none padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__text\"><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Erase.bg, Upscale.media, WatermarkRemover.io</h2><p>I&#8217;ve decided to group these three together since they&#8217;re all made by the same company. This is an example of something doing exactly what it says on the tin, they all seem to work pretty well in my testing. Not much more to say other than try them out for yourself, they&#8217;re great. <a href=\"https://www.erase.bg/\">Erase.bg</a>, <a href=\"https://www.upscale.media/\">Upscale.media</a>, <a href=\"https://www.watermarkremover.io/\">WatermarkRemover.io</a>.</p><p>They also have a really excellent <a href=\"https://www.shrink.media/\">image compression tool</a> in their catalogue that I&#8217;ve started to use instead of what I used previously because it&#8217;s so good.</p><p><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed.png\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2126\" data-src=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"381\" data-srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed.png 967w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed-300x118.png 300w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed-768x303.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 967px) 100vw, 967px\" / srcset=\"/media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed.png 967w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed-300x118.png 300w, /media/2022/05/Screenshot-2022-05-20-at-123929-transformed-768x303.png 768w\"></p></div></div></section><section class=\"cb-next-post cb-next-post--type-one\"><div class=\"cb-next-post__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-next-post__prev\"><p>Previous post:</p><p class=\"cb-next-post__title\"><a href=\"/blog/my-top-10-best-vs-code-extensions/\" rel=\"prev\">My Top 10 Best VS Code Extensions</a></p></div><div class=\"cb-next-post__next\"><p>Next post:</p><p class=\"cb-next-post__title\"><a href=\"/blog/glassmorphism/\" rel=\"next\">Glassmorphism</a></p></div></section><section class=\"cb-comments cb-comments--type-one\"><div class=\"cb-comments__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><div id=\"respond\" class=\"comment-respond\"><h3 id=\"reply-title\" class=\"comment-reply-title\">Leave a Reply <small><a rel